## If you hand an agent your repo

Write down the rules a new hire would need, and put the incident next to each one. The *why* is what keeps the rule from getting "optimized away" by the next session. [`CLAUDE.md`](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory "Claude Code: memory and CLAUDE.md") turned out to be a team wiki for a team of one human.

